 data-testid="NavList-link" href="/en/authentication/troubleshooting-commit-signature-verification/checking-your-commit-and-tag-signature-verification-status"><span class="Primer_Brand__NavList-module__NavList__labelArea___N5Ya6"><span class="Primer_Brand__NavList-module__NavList__label___cZ4Jt">Check verification status</span></span></a></div></li><li class="Primer_Brand__NavList-module__NavList__item___OceIg Primer_Brand__NavList-module__NavList__item--level-2___AEntj Primer_Brand__NavList-module__NavList__item--leaf___SN9hT" data-testid="NavList-item"><div class="Primer_Brand__NavList-module__NavList__itemContent___TyAP4"><a class="Primer_Brand__NavList-module__NavList__link___lJiXk" aria-current="false" data-testid="NavList-link" href="/en/authentication/troubleshooting-commit-signature-verification/using-a-verified-email-address-in-your-gpg-key"><span class="Primer_Brand__NavList-module__NavList__labelArea___N5Ya6"><span class="Primer_Brand__NavList-module__NavList__label___cZ4Jt">Use verified email in GPG key</span></span></a></div></li></ul></li></ul></nav></div></div></div></nav></div><div class="flex-column flex-1 min-width-0 DefaultLayout_stickyStack__mf76f"><main id="main-content" class="DefaultLayout_mainContent__UI2BH"><div class="px-3 px-md-6 mt-4 mb-4"><div class="ArticleGridLayout_containerBox__lLLio ArticleGridLayout_containerBoxXxl__SphGC"><div style="grid-area:topper" class="ArticleGridLayout_heroTopper__bCpVj"><div class="d-flex flex-items-baseline flex-justify-between" data-container="title"><h1 id="title-h1" class="border-bottom-0 ArticleTitle_title__wOdiS">Viewing and managing your sessions</h1></div></div><div id="article-intro" style="grid-area:intro" class="f4 pb-4 ArticleGridLayout_heroIntro__IvIoX"><div class="mb-3 Lead_container__m3L5f _page-intro" data-container="lead" data-testid="lead" data-search="lead"><p>You can view and revoke your active sessions in your settings.</p></div><div class="ViewMarkdownButton_belowIntroPlacement__MKGvm"><div class="ViewMarkdownButton_controls__jbwAh"><button class="Primer_Brand__Button-module__Button___lDruK Primer_Brand__Button-module__Button--secondary___akMC2 Primer_Brand__Button-module__Button--size-medium___EyCyw text-decoration-none ViewMarkdownButton_button__chhfE ViewMarkdownButton_copyButton__haGNh" type="button"><span class="Primer_Brand__Button-module__Button__text___Z3ocU"><span class="Primer_Brand__Text-module__Text___pecHN Primer_Brand__Text-module__Text-font--mona-sans___GpzSG Primer_Brand__Text-module__Text--default___DChoE Primer_Brand__Text-module__Text--200___XAIGT Primer_Brand__Text-module__Text--antialiased___fYDxq Primer_Brand__Text-module__Text--weight-medium___E0iQL Primer_Brand__Button-module__Button--label___lUBc0 Primer_Brand__Button-module__Button--label-medium___DW2TM Primer_Brand__Button-module__Button--label-secondary___DRJoJ">Copy markdown</span></span></button><button type="button" aria-label="More Markdown options" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk ViewMarkdownButton_button__chhfE ViewMarkdownButton_dropdownButton__NBR2_" data-loading="false" data-size="medium" data-variant="default" id="_R_kkr3an76_"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-triangle-down" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:text-bottom"><path d="m4.427 7.427 3.396 3.396a.25.25 0 0 0 .354 0l3.396-3.396A.25.25 0 0 0 11.396 7H4.604a.25.25 0 0 0-.177.427Z"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div data-container="article" style="grid-area:content" data-search="article-body"><div id="article-contents" data-article-body="true"><div class="MarkdownContent_markdownBody__v5MYy markdown-body"><p>You can view a list of devices that have logged into your account, and revoke any sessions that you don&#x27;t recognize.</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>In the upper-right corner of any page on GitHub, click your profile picture, then click <strong><svg version="1.1" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="octicon octicon-gear" aria-label="gear" role="img"><path d="M8 0a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 .701.031C9.444.095 9.99.645 10.16 1.29l.288 1.107c.018.066.079.158.212.224.231.114.454.243.668.386.123.082.233.09.299.071l1.103-.303c.644-.176 1.392.021 1.82.63.27.385.506.792.704 1.218.315.675.111 1.422-.364 1.891l-.814.806c-.049.048-.098.147-.088.294.016.257.016.515 0 .772-.01.147.038.246.088.294l.814.806c.475.469.679 1.216.364 1.891a7.977 7.977 0 0 1-.704 1.217c-.428.61-1.176.807-1.82.63l-1.102-.302c-.067-.019-.177-.011-.3.071a5.909 5.909 0 0 1-.668.386c-.133.066-.194.158-.211.224l-.29 1.106c-.168.646-.715 1.196-1.458 1.26a8.006 8.006 0 0 1-1.402 0c-.743-.064-1.289-.614-1.458-1.26l-.289-1.106c-.018-.066-.079-.158-.212-.224a5.738 5.738 0 0 1-.668-.386c-.123-.082-.233-.09-.299-.071l-1.103.303c-.644.176-1.392-.021-1.82-.63a8.12 8.12 0 0 1-.704-1.218c-.315-.675-.111-1.422.363-1.891l.815-.806c.05-.048.098-.147.088-.294a6.214 6.214 0 0 1 0-.772c.01-.147-.038-.246-.088-.294l-.815-.806C.635 6.045.431 5.298.746 4.623a7.92 7.92 0 0 1 .704-1.217c.428-.61 1.176-.807 1.82-.63l1.102.302c.067.019.177.011.3-.071.214-.143.437-.272.668-.386.133-.066.194-.158.211-.224l.29-1.106C6.009.645 6.556.095 7.299.03 7.53.01 7.764 0 8 0Zm-.571 1.525c-.036.003-.108.036-.137.146l-.289 1.105c-.147.561-.549.967-.998 1.189-.173.086-.34.183-.5.29-.417.278-.97.423-1.529.27l-1.103-.303c-.109-.03-.175.016-.195.045-.22.312-.412.644-.573.99-.014.031-.021.11.059.19l.815.806c.411.406.562.957.53 1.456a4.709 4.709 0 0 0 0 .582c.032.499-.119 1.05-.53 1.456l-.815.806c-.081.08-.073.159-.059.19.162.346.353.677.573.989.02.03.085.076.195.046l1.102-.303c.56-.153 1.113-.008 1.53.27.161.107.328.204.501.29.447.222.85.629.997 1.189l.289 1.105c.029.109.101.143.137.146a6.6 6.6 0 0 0 1.142 0c.036-.003.108-.036.137-.146l.289-1.105c.147-.561.549-.967.998-1.189.173-.086.34-.183.5-.29.417-.278.97-.423 1.529-.27l1.103.303c.109.029.175-.016.195-.045.22-.313.411-.644.573-.99.014-.031.021-.11-.059-.19l-.815-.806c-.411-.406-.562-.957-.53-1.456a4.709 4.709 0 0 0 0-.582c-.032-.499.119-1.05.53-1.456l.815-.806c.081-.08.073-.159.059-.19a6.464 6.464 0 0 0-.573-.989c-.02-.03-.085-.076-.195-.046l-1.102.303c-.56.153-1.113.008-1.53-.27a4.44 4.44 0 0 0-.501-.29c-.447-.222-.85-.629-.997-1.189l-.289-1.105c-.029-.11-.101-.143-.137-.146a6.6 6.6 0 0 0-1.142 0ZM11 8a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0ZM9.5 8a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-3.001.001A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 9.5 8Z"></path></svg> Settings</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>In the &quot;Access&quot; section of the sidebar, click <strong><svg version="1.1" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="octicon octicon-broadcast" aria-label="broadcast" role="img"><path d="M8.75 8.582v5.668a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0V8.582a1.75 1.75 0 1 1 1.5 0Zm3.983-7.125a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06.026A7.976 7.976 0 0 1 16 7c0 2.139-.84 4.083-2.207 5.517a.75.75 0 1 1-1.086-1.034A6.474 6.474 0 0 0 14.5 7a6.474 6.474 0 0 0-1.793-4.483.75.75 0 0 1 .026-1.06Zm-9.466 0c.3.286.312.76.026 1.06A6.474 6.474 0 0 0 1.5 7a6.47 6.47 0 0 0 1.793 4.483.75.75 0 0 1-1.086 1.034A7.973 7.973 0 0 1 0 7c0-2.139.84-4.083 2.207-5.517a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-.026Zm8.556 2.321A4.988 4.988 0 0 1 13 7a4.988 4.988 0 0 1-1.177 3.222.75.75 0 1 1-1.146-.967A3.487 3.487 0 0 0 11.5 7c0-.86-.309-1.645-.823-2.255a.75.75 0 0 1 1.146-.967Zm-6.492.958A3.48 3.48 0 0 0 4.5 7a3.48 3.48 0 0 0 .823 2.255.75.75 0 0 1-1.146.967A4.981 4.981 0 0 1 3 7a4.982 4.982 0 0 1 1.188-3.236.75.75 0 1 1 1.143.972Z"></path></svg> Sessions</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Under &quot;Web sessions&quot;, you can see your active web sessions.</p>
<p>Under &quot;GitHub Mobile sessions&quot;, you can see a list of devices that have logged into your account via the GitHub Mobile app.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>To see the web session details, click <strong>See more</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>To revoke a web session, click <strong>Revoke session</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Optionally, to revoke a GitHub Mobile session, go back to the Sessions overview page and click <strong>Revoke</strong> next to the device you want to revoke.</p>
<div class="ghd-alert ghd-alert-accent" data-container="alert"><p class="ghd-alert-title"><svg version="1.1" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="octicon mr-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p>
<p>
Revoking a mobile session signs you out of the GitHub Mobile application on that device and removes it as a second-factor option.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="further-information" tabindex="-1"><a class="heading-link" href="#further-information">Further information<span class="heading-link-symbol" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="/en/authentication/keeping-your-account-and-data-secure/about-authentication-to-github#session-cookies">About authentication to GitHub</a></li>
</ul></div></div></div></div></div></main><div aria-hidden="true" class="FooterDivider_footerDivider__6q_kx"></div><footer class="Primer_Brand__MinimalFooter-module__MinimalFooter___QucKd DocsFooter_docsFooter__dl5re" data-container="footer"><div class="Primer_Brand__MinimalFooter-module__MinimalFooter__section____O9_E"><section class="Primer_Brand__MinimalFooter-module__MinimalFooter__top___H_7ju"><div class="Primer_Brand__MinimalFooter-module__MinimalFooter__container___phzVn"><div class="Primer_Brand__MinimalFooter-module__MinimalFooter__top-row___ZGvWR"><a href="https://github.com" class="Primer_Brand__MinimalFooter-module__MinimalFooter__logo___GvtJc" data-analytics-event="{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;Footer&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;go to home&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;text:home&quot;}" aria-label="GitHub"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-mark-github" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:text-bottom"><path d="M10.226 17.284c-2.965-.36-5.054-2.493-5.054-5.256 0-1.123.404-2.336 1.078-3.144-.292-.741-.247-2.314.09-2.965.898-.112 2.111.36 2.83 1.01.853-.269 1.752-.404 2.853-.404 1.1 0 1.999.135 2.807.382.696-.629 1.932-1.1 2.83-.988.315.606.36 2.179.067 2.942.72.854 1.101 2 1.101 3.167 0 2.763-2.089 4.852-5.098 5.234.763.494 1.28 1.572 1.28 2.807v2.336c0 .674.561 1.056 1.235.786 4.066-1.55 7.255-5.615 7.255-10.646C23.5 6.188 18.334 1 11.978 1 5.62 1 .5 6.188.5 12.545c0 4.986 3.167 9.12 7.435 10.669.606.225 1.19-.18 1.19-.786V20.63a2.9 2.9 0 0 1-1.078.224c-1.483 0-2.359-.808-2.987-2.313-.247-.607-.517-.966-1.034-1.033-.27-.023-.359-.135-.359-.27 0-.27.45-.471.898-.471.652 0 1.213.404 1.797 1.235.45.651.921.943 1.483.943.561 0 .92-.202 1.437-.719.382-.381.674-.718.944-.943"></path></svg></a><div class="Primer_Brand__MinimalFooter-module__MinimalFooter__top-actions___QIaDM"><button type="button" class="Primer_Brand